      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'After the party uncovered Enfer''s dark secret, they left the elven tower. 
    The dark elves and elves grieved for their leader while still continuing their
    peaceful life.


    The party continued on to the last area which was consumed
    by a strange curse, one that roused the undead that began hunting the party. 
    While narrowly evading capture or death the party found a secert bunker with
    the remains of the last king commonly known as the tyrant king.  They went in
    as they felt the essence of the horde seeping into the bunker and delved in to
    learn the secrets.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc36b3fdc14f47ebb36fd484a67e268a, type: 2}
